 live folding

- usage.query API: apiproxy usage domain (schema/rpc-map/fetch routes/client)
- dsh-usage-query service: cross-session token aggregation; persisted
  sessions via revision-cached raw scans, live sessions via incremental
  in-memory folds (only tail events iterated per query) + background
  warm-up at mount, so panel queries are near-instant even on a live
  conversation with millions of streaming chunk events
- ui-usage client: sidebar-foot trigger + usage modal (today/7d/30d/all
  presets + custom dates, day/model/session grouping, bars + totals)
- web-app bundle wiring, web dev helper scripts, implementation notes
